"section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":9605,"title":"","description":"2","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Animation"],"id":9605,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Family Guy Presents Stewie Griffin: The Untold Story","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk47/shows/5e2e9b14-a6e2-4490-a12d-3b713a8a4656.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk46/shows/c7eadaf9-5ccf-428a-8850-6dc6a562daae.jpg","likes":36,"dislikes":1,"views":3942,"release_date":"1127779200000","length":5299,"description":"The major sub-plot circles around the youngest Griffin, Stewie, who has a near-death experience at a pool when a lifeguard chair falls on him, but he survives. After having a vision of being in Hell, he decides to change his ways, but this doesn't last long. While watching television, he and Brian spot a man that looks like Stewie. Brian is convinced that he is Stewie's real father, until Stewie learns that the man is actually himself as an adult, taking a vacation from his own time period. Baby Stewie visits thirty years later to discover that his adult self, going by the name Stu, is a single blue-collar middle-aged virgin working at a Circuit City-type store. Meanwhile, Peter and Lois are trying to teach their two older kids, Meg and Chris, to date. In the future, Chris, who hasn't changed much, is working as a cop and is married to a foul-mouthed hustler named Vanessa. Meg is now called Ron, since she had a sex-change after college.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.7}],"value":7.7,"age":"r"},"episode_id":9605,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}